# Drizzle + D1

Read and write app data through `db` from `@/lib/db`. Keep `d1Query` for SQL Drizzle cannot express.

Schema lives in `src/lib/db/schema.ts`. After a schema change run `pnpm db:generate`, review `drizzle/`, then `pnpm db:check`. Apply with `pnpm db:migrate` only when this app owns the D1 database.

Do not rename better-auth columns (`email_verified`, `created_at`, `user_id`, and the rest). potencia-dashboard and potencia-products share those tables.

Apps that share another app's database set `DB_MIGRATIONS=disabled` (potencia-products does this for the dashboard database). `pnpm db:migrate` and `pnpm db:push` must refuse. Do not point `db:push` at a shared database.

Follow `.cursor/skills/drizzle-d1/SKILL.md`. better-auth stays on `drizzleAdapter` with `transaction: false`.
